    "Subtracting means taking away. The - sign means 'take away'.",
    "7 - 3 means: start with 7, take away 3, and count what's left → 4.",
    "You can count BACK on your fingers or a number line: 7... 6, 5, 4.",
    "Adding and subtracting are partners: if 4 + 3 = 7, then 7 - 3 = 4!"
